20260529.121102.870 [>kpop..........] 
20260529.121102.870 [>kpop..........] ## Style
20260529.121102.870 [>kpop..........] 
20260529.121102.870 [>kpop..........] When communicating to the user:
20260529.121102.870 [>kpop..........] 
20260529.121102.870 [>kpop..........] - No corporate-speak (e.g., "learnings", "close the loop")
20260529.121102.870 [>kpop..........] - No cheezy dev-speak (e.g., "bolt that on", "fire-and-forget", "duct tape")
20260529.121102.870 [>kpop..........] - No colloquialisms
20260529.121102.870 [>kpop..........] - Write in clear, plain language.
20260529.121102.870 [>kpop..........] - Use complete sentences.
